    "title": "3D Chat AI Creation Platform \"EmemeAI\" Connects Original AI Characters to All Sorts of External Applications | User | dailytimesleader.com",
    "text": "Registration for apps that connect with AI characters is now open!\nEmeme Inc. has launched a new system called \"AI Character Hub\" on its 3D chat AI creation platform. 'EmemeAI' allows users to connect AI characters they create to external applications. This system was released on March 27, 2025. With this new system, users will be able to interact with their own, original AI characters across various platforms and applications.\n[App] https://chat.ememe.ai/\n[Video] https://youtu.be/a5jdFbAZfHo\nThis press release features multimedia. View the full release here: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20250323226458/en/\nAI Character Hub\nAI Character Hub\nWith \"AI Character Hub\", Users can bring AI characters they have created or those created by other creators who have permitted external connections into various applications.\nCurrently, the applications compatible with EmemeAI characters are as follows:\n1. VRChat\nIn the social VR platform \"VRChat,\" users can enjoy conversations with AI characters and communication between AI characters within the world.\nFirst, we will offer a feature that allows world creators to place EmemeAI characters as AI-NPCs within their worlds. Furthermore, in the official Ememe world , even users who cannot create worlds can enjoy conversations with AI characters.\n2. EmemeTown Beta Test\nIn the AI sandbox game \"EmemeTown,\" anyone can easily place up to 8 EmemeAI characters in a 3D space and communicate freely with AI-NPCs, even without knowledge of game engines (Unity).\nWe will begin a limited beta test for \"EmemeTown\". For details, please check our official Discord .\n3. future development\nIn the future, we plan to support YouTube, providing functionality for AI characters to live stream in real-time. We are also considering distributing Unity APIs for game developers, allowing the integration of AI characters into their own games and applications.\n4. Invitation for App Integration Registration\nWe are inviting developers who are creating Unity/Web apps to register applications to connect to EmemeAI characters. Interested developers are encouraged to reach out to us for more information.\n[Contact] https://ememe.ai/town#contact\nAbout EmemeAI\n\"EmemeAI\" is a chat AI creation platform where you can create AI characters using your favorite 3D models. The posted AI characters automatically generate conversations and animations, allowing you to chat with people worldwide.\n[Website] https://ememe.ai/\nAbout Ememe Inc.\nCompany Profile\nCompany name: Ememe Inc.\nHead office: Chiyoda-ku, Tokyo\nRepresentative Director: Yuka Kojima\nEstablishment: 2022\nPress Kit\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ergt1OMy1ijP33Be5pTDgt6MvRDOPF6w?usp=sharing\nView source version on businesswire.com: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20250323226458/en/\nContacts Ememe Inc.\nYuka Kojima\nMAIL: info@ememe.ai\nStock Quote API & Stock News API supplied by www.cloudquote.io\nQuotes delayed at least 20 minutes.\nBy accessing this page, you agree to the following\nPrivacy Policy and Terms and Conditions .",
